WEBVTT

00:07.924 --> 00:10.927
[♪ pensive theme music playing]

01:08.443 --> 01:09.986
[♪ theme concludes]

01:12.906 --> 01:14.908
[alarm blaring]

01:20.955 --> 01:22.957
[alarm continues blaring]

01:33.927 --> 01:35.136
[voice]
He's dead.

01:40.183 --> 01:41.267
Who?

01:45.146 --> 01:47.022
[breathing shakily]

01:47.023 --> 01:48.525
I don't know you.

01:51.027 --> 01:52.361
[clicks tongue]
Don't go in there.

01:52.362 --> 01:55.864
- Stop it.
- I am telling you, go back.

01:55.865 --> 01:57.074
No.

01:57.075 --> 01:58.409
[sighs]

02:00.703 --> 02:02.664
His brains are on the floor.

02:05.500 --> 02:07.502
[faint sobbing in distance]

02:08.753 --> 02:10.130
You're lying.

02:16.636 --> 02:19.639
- [faint sobbing continues]
- [alarm continues blaring]

02:24.102 --> 02:26.979
[alarm intensifying]

02:26.980 --> 02:28.815
[fire crackling softly]

02:48.751 --> 02:51.254
[shivering breaths]

02:53.756 --> 02:55.758
- Hey.
- Hey.

03:01.806 --> 03:03.099
Fuck.

03:04.684 --> 03:06.227
[shivering]

03:09.480 --> 03:10.689
You been out?

03:10.690 --> 03:12.191
Yeah, thought about
setting up a watch,

03:12.192 --> 03:14.611
in case one of those patrols
gets too close.

03:15.945 --> 03:18.447
Made it about an hour.
[chuckles]

03:18.448 --> 03:19.615
We'll do shifts.

03:19.616 --> 03:21.325
I'll get you something
to warm up.

03:21.326 --> 03:23.077
- Mm-hmm.
- Fuck.

03:24.329 --> 03:26.955
It did not look like that
in the dark.

03:26.956 --> 03:29.291
Shit. Hey, you two.
Hey. Come on.

03:29.292 --> 03:31.168
- [groaning]
- Get up, get up, get up.

03:31.169 --> 03:32.794
- Let me see.
- Well, it's alright.

03:32.795 --> 03:34.129
Now that we know
what we're dealing with,

03:34.130 --> 03:36.465
we can come up with a plan.

03:36.466 --> 03:38.176
- Right?
- Definitely.

03:39.177 --> 03:41.011
- [Mel] Fuck.
- [Nora] Oh, shit.

03:41.012 --> 03:43.639
Wha-- It's-- it's a city, Abs.

03:43.640 --> 03:45.515
I thought it would be like
a tent colony or something.

03:45.516 --> 03:46.975
Well, we knew they had lights.

03:46.976 --> 03:48.560
Yeah, I thought they were
from little generators

03:48.561 --> 03:49.978
- like we use at the FOB.
- [Manny] Nope.

03:49.979 --> 03:51.730
They got full
fuckin' power lines.

03:51.731 --> 03:53.357
[Nora]
Oh, well, isn't that great?

03:53.358 --> 03:55.817
[Owen]
Power lines aren't a problem.

03:55.818 --> 03:57.194
Here are the problems.

03:57.195 --> 03:59.488
They've got four main gates,
no other ins or outs.

03:59.489 --> 04:01.531
Guard towers
flanking each exit.

04:01.532 --> 04:04.409
Mounted patrols,
all heavily armed,
overlapping routes.

04:04.410 --> 04:05.869
These guys are trained.

04:05.870 --> 04:08.414
[Owen] Yeah, they've got
some vets down there, for sure.

04:09.499 --> 04:11.334
But, okay.

04:12.335 --> 04:14.336
Let's just say
we get past the gates,

04:14.337 --> 04:16.338
the guards, the patrols--

04:16.339 --> 04:17.882
[Manny]
Ah, they also got dogs.

04:19.217 --> 04:21.469
'Kay. [chuckles]
And the dogs.

04:22.929 --> 04:25.098
We still don't know
where Joel is in there.

04:27.350 --> 04:29.685
Okay, how about this?

04:29.686 --> 04:33.021
We ambush a patrol.
We tie 'em up.

04:33.022 --> 04:35.023
- Make 'em tell us where Joel is.
- [Owen] Make them?

04:35.024 --> 04:36.733
Yeah, we said that we weren't
gonna hurt anyone else.

04:36.734 --> 04:38.694
- Just Joel. I'm not gonna--
- Mel, fuck. Relax.

04:38.695 --> 04:41.863
I'm not saying we would.
I'm saying we bluff.

04:41.864 --> 04:44.116
Scare 'em, you know?

04:44.117 --> 04:47.035
And if they don't talk,
then what?

04:47.036 --> 04:49.330
Yeah, it's not like
we could let 'em go.

04:55.628 --> 05:00.757
I do have the beginnings
of an idea for a plan, maybe.

05:00.758 --> 05:03.051
Just need some time.
I have to let it crystallize.

05:03.052 --> 05:04.387
But you're onto something?

05:05.680 --> 05:06.848
I'm onto something.

05:07.765 --> 05:10.935
Okay. Then let's buy you
some time, then.

05:12.562 --> 05:13.938
I'll take the next watch.

05:14.814 --> 05:15.898
Where's the spot?

05:17.650 --> 05:20.068
Up the hill.
A little outcropping.

05:20.069 --> 05:21.486
You'll know it
when you see it.

05:21.487 --> 05:23.031
Okay.

05:24.324 --> 05:26.200
Better be
a good fuckin' plan.

05:31.914 --> 05:33.916
[♪ tense music playing]

05:34.709 --> 05:36.752
[wind whooshing loudly]

05:36.753 --> 05:38.880
[shivering]
Oh, fuck.

05:40.715 --> 05:42.300
Fuckin' hour out here?

05:50.975 --> 05:52.393
[lighter clicking]

05:54.479 --> 05:55.480
[gas hissing]

06:06.366 --> 06:08.034
You don't actually
have a plan, do you?

06:09.535 --> 06:10.661
No, I do.

06:12.413 --> 06:16.167
The plan is to
convince her to go back.

06:18.669 --> 06:20.170
'Cause if we don't,
the only people

06:20.171 --> 06:21.839
getting killed out here
are us.

06:24.634 --> 06:25.802
[knocking]

06:28.721 --> 06:30.723
[knocking continues]

06:33.643 --> 06:35.186
I'm coming.

06:36.521 --> 06:37.605
[sighs]

06:38.356 --> 06:39.357
[groans]

06:43.361 --> 06:45.028
- [scoffs]
- Hey.

06:45.029 --> 06:46.988
Wow, you look like shit.

06:46.989 --> 06:48.657
Dude, what do you want?

06:48.658 --> 06:50.826
I want you to fulfill
your obligation

06:50.827 --> 06:52.828
to the community
of Jackson Hole, Wyoming.

06:52.829 --> 06:54.830
- Mm-hmm?
- 8:00 a.m. patrol.

06:54.831 --> 06:56.373
[groaning]
It's eight?

06:56.374 --> 06:58.166
No, it's-- 7:30.
But you're riding with me

06:58.167 --> 06:59.376
and I like to be on time.

06:59.377 --> 07:01.254
Okay, gimme a minute,
I'll get changed.

07:02.713 --> 07:04.465
I heard you had quite
the night after I left.

07:05.716 --> 07:07.843
Oh. Yeah.

07:07.844 --> 07:09.845
Yeah, uh,
she kissed me.

07:09.846 --> 07:11.346
It was just Dina
being Dina.

07:11.347 --> 07:12.764
She was high,
she won't even remember it--

07:12.765 --> 07:14.850
Uh, I was talking about
some fight

07:14.851 --> 07:17.769
you had with Seth and Joel.

07:17.770 --> 07:18.896
You kissed her?

07:19.772 --> 07:21.857
- No.
- Wow, Ellie, come on.

07:21.858 --> 07:23.275
We-- we've been
broken up one week,

07:23.276 --> 07:24.734
- and you made a move on her?
- I-- I didn't.

07:24.735 --> 07:25.944
- I didn't make--
- Seriously?

07:25.945 --> 07:28.029
Dina-- you--
It didn't mean anything.

07:28.030 --> 07:29.573
She was probably just trying
to make you jealous.

07:29.574 --> 07:31.032
It didn't mean anything.
It didn't.

07:31.033 --> 07:32.701
- I-- I wouldn't do that.
- I'm screwing with you, man.

07:32.702 --> 07:33.869
I already know.
I don't care.

07:33.870 --> 07:35.788
Come on, get dressed.
We gotta go.

07:36.622 --> 07:38.040
You're the worst.

07:39.500 --> 07:40.959
It's kind of fucked up
you did that, though.

07:40.960 --> 07:42.003
- [scoffs]
- [slams door]

07:43.838 --> 07:45.255
[Ellie]
What's everyone doing?

07:45.256 --> 07:46.882
[Jesse]
Council put the town on alert.

07:46.883 --> 07:49.468
Last night, Kylie and Max
found a pile of dead infected

07:49.469 --> 07:51.386
near Seven Cabins.

07:51.387 --> 07:53.889
- Frozen stiff.
- Okay?

07:53.890 --> 07:56.266
They didn't think
anything of it
until 30 live ones

07:56.267 --> 07:59.060
broke through
from underneath the corpses.

07:59.061 --> 08:01.646
They're using their own dead
like insulation.

08:01.647 --> 08:03.940
Thirty? Fuck.
They okay?

08:03.941 --> 08:05.775
Yeah, sprinted back
on their horses.

08:05.776 --> 08:07.569
Sent a squad out
to clear the infected,

08:07.570 --> 08:09.446
but now we're thinking
we don't know how many

08:09.447 --> 08:11.323
are underneath the snow.

08:11.324 --> 08:14.075
Could be 30 more.
Could be a thousand more.

08:14.076 --> 08:16.453
A thousand?
Get the fuck outta here.

08:16.454 --> 08:18.288
[chuckles softly]
Ah, yes.

08:18.289 --> 08:20.832
Certainty masquerading
as knowledge.

08:20.833 --> 08:23.001
- It's very Ellie of you.
- Suck my dick.

08:23.002 --> 08:25.587
Also, somebody told
the council a ghost story

08:25.588 --> 08:27.589
about the world's
smartest infected,

08:27.590 --> 08:29.758
and now everybody's spooked
out of their minds.

08:29.759 --> 08:32.427
It wasn't a ghost story.
You know, no offense, man.

08:32.428 --> 08:34.346
I'm gonna do my patrol
with Joel.

08:34.347 --> 08:36.473
Um, yes, offense,
'cause that's the one person

08:36.474 --> 08:38.099
you've been avoiding
like the plague.

08:38.100 --> 08:39.935
Well, we're better now, okay?

08:39.936 --> 08:41.645
As of when?
'Cause last night I did--

08:41.646 --> 08:42.938
Yeah, I know
what happened last night.

08:42.939 --> 08:44.315
Can you shut the fuck...

08:47.610 --> 08:48.611
[sighs]

08:51.239 --> 08:52.864
My shit with Joel
is complicated.

08:52.865 --> 08:54.699
I know that.
From the outside,

08:54.700 --> 08:56.451
it probably looks really bad.

08:56.452 --> 08:57.953
It has been really bad.

08:57.954 --> 09:00.540
But I'm still me,
he's still Joel, and we--

09:03.042 --> 09:05.794
And nothing's ever gonna
change that, ever.

09:05.795 --> 09:07.295
So, you can all
stop talking about us,

09:07.296 --> 09:10.131
worrying about us,
and thinking about us, alright?

09:10.132 --> 09:12.051
So, you two hashed it out?

09:13.302 --> 09:15.137
Uh... Alright.

09:15.972 --> 09:18.807
Now, if you don't mind,
I'm gonna go on patrol with him

09:18.808 --> 09:21.017
like fucking
daddy-daughter day.

09:21.018 --> 09:23.395
- Okay? Okay.
- He already went out.

09:23.396 --> 09:25.647
What? With who?

09:25.648 --> 09:27.899
Dina.
They left an hour ago.

09:27.900 --> 09:29.401
For what it's worth,
he wanted to go with you,

09:29.402 --> 09:31.861
but he said
we should let you sleep.

09:31.862 --> 09:34.656
- Let's hit the restaurant.
- I'm not hungry.

09:34.657 --> 09:36.491
Neither am I,
but Maria wants to talk to you.

09:36.492 --> 09:38.703
And don't ask.
I don't know.

09:39.537 --> 09:41.246
[Tommy]
Now, the most likely outcome
is none of this

09:41.247 --> 09:43.665
is necessary, okay?

09:43.666 --> 09:45.375
You wanna
remind me next week
how I made y'all

09:45.376 --> 09:47.043
go through
all this crap for no reason?

09:47.044 --> 09:49.546
- [townsperson] Ha. Yeah.
- Nothin' will make me happier.

09:49.547 --> 09:50.755
But you know the drill.

09:50.756 --> 09:53.925
Prepare for the worst,
hope for the best.

09:53.926 --> 09:55.885
Now, half of y'all is hung over
and want me to shut up.

09:55.886 --> 09:57.345
- [laughter]
- But, uh,

09:57.346 --> 09:59.055
I'ma go through this anyway
'cause it's been a minute.

09:59.056 --> 10:02.434
If you see flares,
if you hear bells,

10:02.435 --> 10:03.685
stop what you're doin'.

10:03.686 --> 10:05.938
You follow the plan.
What's the plan?

10:06.939 --> 10:08.189
Vanessa, what's the plan?

10:08.190 --> 10:10.400
We go to the forest?

10:10.401 --> 10:11.776
- [laughter]
- To the forest?

10:11.777 --> 10:13.862
Do not go
to the forest, sweetheart.

10:13.863 --> 10:15.238
Be such a bad idea.

10:15.239 --> 10:17.699
- [laughter]
- Now, young ones, old ones,

10:17.700 --> 10:19.868
right quick into basements
and cellars.

10:19.869 --> 10:22.203
You lock the doors,
you reinforce, shelter in place

10:22.204 --> 10:23.705
'til we tell you it's safe
to come out.

10:23.706 --> 10:25.290
Now, for the rest of us,
where do we go?

10:25.291 --> 10:26.875
- [crowd] Up!
- Up, that's right.

10:26.876 --> 10:28.960
Rooftops, second floors.
What do we bring?

10:28.961 --> 10:30.211
[crowd] Guns!

10:30.212 --> 10:31.880
- You wanted to--
- That means everyone is carrying

10:31.881 --> 10:33.048
when we're on alert.

10:33.049 --> 10:34.758
Sidearms, rifles,
take 'em with you.

10:34.759 --> 10:36.760
Keep 'em on you.
Safeties, please.

10:36.761 --> 10:38.386
Somebody shot themselves
in the leg last week.

10:38.387 --> 10:39.888
- [laughter]
- [townsperson] Earl!

10:39.889 --> 10:42.057
- Alright, don't be Earl.
- [laughter]

10:42.058 --> 10:44.768
Now, bigger weapons,
security team will handle those.

10:44.769 --> 10:47.605
For the rest of you,
if there's a breach...

10:48.606 --> 10:51.983
God forbid,
stay off the main street.

10:51.984 --> 10:54.235
Last place you wanna be,
trust me on that one.

10:54.236 --> 10:56.071
Any questions?

10:56.072 --> 10:58.615
Alright then.
Get with your group leaders.

10:58.616 --> 11:00.241
Spread the word
to your neighbors.

11:00.242 --> 11:01.951
- Let's get everyone in the loop.
- Go hug Daddy.

11:01.952 --> 11:03.286
Tell him he did good.

11:03.287 --> 11:04.996
[people chattering]

11:04.997 --> 11:06.040
Come on.

11:07.875 --> 11:10.585
This is bullshit, right?
It's just a drill.

11:10.586 --> 11:12.128
Yep, it's a drill.

11:12.129 --> 11:14.464
Unless we're attacked,
and then it's not.

11:14.465 --> 11:16.050
Correct.
[whistles]

11:17.843 --> 11:20.221
- Oh, fuck me.
- Stay where you are.

11:21.305 --> 11:23.098
- [sighs]
- Thank you.

11:23.099 --> 11:24.850
Seth, we have something to say?

11:26.227 --> 11:29.104
Yeah.
Um, so last night,

11:29.105 --> 11:31.356
I obviously had a few too many.

11:31.357 --> 11:33.692
It happens to everyone.
People get drunk

11:33.693 --> 11:35.610
and say awful shit
they've never thought before.

11:35.611 --> 11:37.780
- Ellie.
- No, that's-- that's fair.

11:39.281 --> 11:40.616
I shouldn't have said it.

11:43.077 --> 11:46.288
I shouldn't even thought it.
I'm sorry.

11:48.791 --> 11:52.877
I made you two some sandwiches
if you're going out there.

11:52.878 --> 11:53.921
[clears throat]

11:56.048 --> 11:57.507
They're, uh, steak.

11:57.508 --> 11:58.801
Mm.

12:03.472 --> 12:04.765
- Thanks.
- Yeah.

12:05.808 --> 12:08.351
Well... [sighs]

12:08.352 --> 12:10.354
- You be safe out there.
- [Ellie] Yep.

12:21.073 --> 12:22.824
[guard]
Cottonwood run, moving out.

12:22.825 --> 12:24.033
[horses snorting]

12:24.034 --> 12:25.994
Are we worrying about that?

12:25.995 --> 12:27.495
[Jesse]
Nah, it'll just be
up in the mountains.

12:27.496 --> 12:28.997
Fucking hope so.

12:28.998 --> 12:31.166
Ten seconds in,
I already can't feel my ass.

12:31.167 --> 12:32.167
[gates creaking shut]

12:32.168 --> 12:34.211
[thunder rumbling]

12:41.552 --> 12:43.554
[wind whooshing]

12:44.889 --> 12:46.807
[shivering]
Goddammit.

12:48.184 --> 12:49.477
[exhales sharply]

12:52.521 --> 12:54.148
[shivering]

12:58.068 --> 12:59.403
Fuck it.

13:06.535 --> 13:08.537
[horses neighing in distance]

13:09.705 --> 13:12.708
[people chattering in distance]

13:15.920 --> 13:17.922
[chatter continues]

13:24.929 --> 13:27.932
[♪ dramatic music playing]

13:32.728 --> 13:34.730
[wind whistling]

13:38.484 --> 13:40.401
[townsperson 1]
We're runnin' out of rope.

13:40.402 --> 13:41.402
One, two, three.

13:41.403 --> 13:43.738
[chains rattling]

13:43.739 --> 13:45.533
Whoa! Rope it.

13:48.160 --> 13:50.329
[townsperson 2]
Take those ammo cans.
Put 'em right there.

13:53.666 --> 13:56.252
[people chattering]

13:56.627 --> 13:58.294
[officer] [over radio]
This is mountaintop patrol.

13:58.295 --> 13:59.547
Visibility dropping.

14:03.384 --> 14:04.593
Mountaintop, repeat.

14:05.469 --> 14:06.928
[radio cutting out]
Again, low visibility.

14:06.929 --> 14:08.138
We're coming back to camp.

14:09.431 --> 14:10.765
Repeat.

14:10.766 --> 14:12.518
[radio static buzzing]

14:15.020 --> 14:16.980
- June.
- Yeah?

14:16.981 --> 14:18.773
Go find Amy in the radio room.

14:18.774 --> 14:20.984
Tell her to crank the signal.
Call all the patrols back.

14:20.985 --> 14:22.444
Okay, I'm on it.

14:25.239 --> 14:28.242
[♪ suspenseful music playing]

14:30.911 --> 14:32.788
[snow pelting,
metal sign clanking]

14:33.789 --> 14:36.666
[Amy] [on radio]
Cottonwood patrol,
return to Jackson ASAP.

14:36.667 --> 14:37.793
[Jesse] What?

14:40.045 --> 14:42.463
- Repeat.
- [Amy] Cottonwood patrol,

14:42.464 --> 14:44.966
- return to Jackson ASAP.
- Yeah, alright.

14:44.967 --> 14:47.094
But I think we're too far out
to make it back.

14:49.221 --> 14:51.139
I know a spot,
we can hole up there.

14:51.140 --> 14:52.682
[Amy]
Copy. Shelter in place

14:52.683 --> 14:54.517
until we contact you.
Stay warm.

14:54.518 --> 14:56.019
[Jesse]
Yeah, you too. Over.

14:56.020 --> 14:58.646
- What spot?
- This way.

14:58.647 --> 15:00.649
[horse snorting]

15:01.817 --> 15:03.819
[banging]

15:07.031 --> 15:08.449
[horse neighing]

15:13.412 --> 15:15.663
- [Ellie] They gonna be okay?
- As soon as they eat.

15:15.664 --> 15:17.415
- Okay, what about us?
- This way.

15:17.416 --> 15:18.584
Okay.

15:24.048 --> 15:26.174
[horses chomping, grunting]

15:26.175 --> 15:28.218
[wind whooshing loudly]

15:33.807 --> 15:35.809
[banging]

15:38.812 --> 15:40.355
[heavy panting]

15:40.356 --> 15:41.398
[Ellie] [whispering]
Fuck.

15:44.109 --> 15:45.568
Am I fucking hallucinating?

15:45.569 --> 15:46.861
[Jesse] Maybe.

15:46.862 --> 15:49.197
Do you see
a 7-Eleven full of weed?

15:49.198 --> 15:50.866
- Yep.
- Then no.

15:52.159 --> 15:53.285
[stove door creaking]

15:55.913 --> 15:57.414
How'd you know
about this place?

15:58.415 --> 15:59.500
Eugene.

16:00.501 --> 16:02.169
He was
my first patrol partner.

16:02.836 --> 16:05.964
One day, he showed it to me,
said he found it a year earlier

16:05.965 --> 16:07.548
when he was on a solo patrol.

16:07.549 --> 16:09.884
Swore me to secrecy.

16:09.885 --> 16:13.138
Said Maria wouldn't be
supportive of his, uh, farming.

16:18.852 --> 16:19.937
[bag zipping]

16:21.355 --> 16:22.439
You okay?

16:24.024 --> 16:26.609
[♪ gentle, solemn music playing]

16:26.610 --> 16:27.820
Yeah.

16:28.779 --> 16:30.197
[fire crackling]

16:31.407 --> 16:34.575
- Eugene was a Firefly?
- Yup.

16:34.576 --> 16:37.078
Just early on, though.

16:37.079 --> 16:39.247
- Quit back in 2010.
- How come?

16:39.248 --> 16:41.667
He said he was tired
of killing people.

16:42.710 --> 16:45.587
- I think he was in Vietnam.
- Oh.

16:46.588 --> 16:48.590
[blowing]

16:51.427 --> 16:54.972
That was a raw deal.
Joel having to put him down.

16:56.640 --> 16:59.018
[sighs]
Fuckin' shame.

17:00.477 --> 17:03.772
Guy makes it through a war,
end up going out like that.

17:06.692 --> 17:09.903
What are you gonna do?
Couldn't be saved.

17:11.363 --> 17:12.656
Yeah.

17:22.332 --> 17:23.333
[grunts]

17:27.796 --> 17:29.798
[people chattering in distance]

17:32.217 --> 17:34.636
[wind whistling]

17:52.696 --> 17:53.697
[exhales sharply]

17:58.660 --> 18:00.079
[grunting]

18:03.957 --> 18:05.249
[sighs]

18:05.250 --> 18:06.460
[grunting]

18:08.337 --> 18:10.547
[screaming]

18:19.348 --> 18:21.433
[wind whooshing]

18:22.726 --> 18:24.728
[groaning]

18:25.896 --> 18:27.898
[panting]

18:36.156 --> 18:39.660
[♪ ominous music playing]

18:44.164 --> 18:46.166
[breathing heavily]

18:50.170 --> 18:53.632
[footsteps crunching]

18:57.261 --> 18:59.763
[♪ ominous music continues]

19:12.151 --> 19:14.153
[snow crunching softly]

19:18.240 --> 19:19.616
[Abby gasping]

19:25.247 --> 19:26.540
[snow crunching]

19:27.583 --> 19:28.959
[exclaiming]

19:30.127 --> 19:33.130
[infected snarling, clamoring]

19:46.351 --> 19:47.603
[screeching]

19:50.731 --> 19:53.734
[clamoring continues]

19:55.944 --> 19:57.946
[panting and grunting]

20:03.243 --> 20:04.870
[Abby yelling]

20:07.581 --> 20:09.791
[♪ tense music playing]

20:11.710 --> 20:13.712
[snarling and screeching]

20:18.300 --> 20:19.967
[grunting]

20:19.968 --> 20:23.013
[clamoring continues]

20:25.849 --> 20:26.892
[Abby screams]

20:28.435 --> 20:29.436
[Abby yells]

20:35.651 --> 20:36.652
[grunts]

20:37.819 --> 20:39.029
Fuck!

20:41.323 --> 20:43.325
[panting]

20:49.373 --> 20:51.374
[snarling]

20:51.375 --> 20:54.002
[Abby gasping]

20:59.383 --> 21:01.468
[grunting]

21:10.310 --> 21:11.561
[growling and snarling]

21:13.230 --> 21:15.023
[Abby whimpering]

21:17.109 --> 21:19.026
[gasping and grunting]

21:19.027 --> 21:20.362
[exclaiming]

21:24.574 --> 21:25.574
[fence snapping]

21:25.575 --> 21:27.619
[infected snarling]

21:28.662 --> 21:30.706
[Abby grunting]

21:32.958 --> 21:35.544
- [Abby yelling]
- [infected screeching]

21:37.838 --> 21:39.381
- [shrieking]
- [gunshot]

21:40.424 --> 21:42.467
[high-pitch ringing]

21:43.051 --> 21:44.927
[muffled voice]
Give me your hand!

21:44.928 --> 21:47.264
[Joel] [normal]
Give me your hand!

21:48.515 --> 21:50.057
- Can you run?
- Yeah.

21:50.058 --> 21:51.935
Run! That way!

21:52.936 --> 21:55.355
[gunshots]

21:56.440 --> 21:58.025
[♪ dramatic music playing]

22:00.235 --> 22:02.279
[door banging]

22:02.654 --> 22:05.198
- [panting]
- [Dina] Joel?

22:07.784 --> 22:09.076
Joel?!

22:09.077 --> 22:11.996
[Joel] Up here.
I'm comin', I'm comin'.

22:11.997 --> 22:13.748
[Abby breathing heavily]

22:13.749 --> 22:15.666
- [Joel] You good?
- [gasping]

22:15.667 --> 22:17.585
Hey, kid!

22:17.586 --> 22:19.920
- Yeah, yeah, I'm good.
- Any bites?

22:19.921 --> 22:21.882
[panting heavily]

22:22.632 --> 22:24.217
Then let's go.

22:24.843 --> 22:26.678
- [door banging]
- Now!

22:29.765 --> 22:31.558
- [banging continues]
- [infected snarling]

22:32.559 --> 22:34.268
- [Dina] What do we do?
- We leave!

22:34.269 --> 22:35.770
Back to Jackson?

22:35.771 --> 22:37.938
It's too far.
We'll freeze before
we get halfway.

22:37.939 --> 22:39.690
- I'm aware.
- Where the fuck
did they even come from?

22:39.691 --> 22:42.318
- Where did you come from?
- The mountain.

22:42.319 --> 22:44.362
[banging continues]

22:44.363 --> 22:45.654
[infected shrieking]

22:45.655 --> 22:47.448
Okay, Joel, if we stay here,
we die.

22:47.449 --> 22:48.866
If we go out there, we die.

22:48.867 --> 22:50.368
[Joel] I don't know,
I don't know, I'm thinkin'!

22:50.369 --> 22:52.453
The lodge.
My friends are holed up

22:52.454 --> 22:54.121
in a lodge halfway up
the mountain.

22:54.122 --> 22:56.957
Not far.
If the infected
are down here,

22:56.958 --> 22:59.127
maybe there aren't
anymore up there.

23:00.545 --> 23:01.963
[banging continues]

23:02.798 --> 23:04.382
Fuck it, it's all we got.
Are your friends armed?

23:04.383 --> 23:05.883
- Yeah.
- Good.

23:05.884 --> 23:07.886
We're gonna need 'em.
Get on.

23:09.763 --> 23:12.766
[infected clamoring]

23:17.145 --> 23:19.563
[radio static]

23:19.564 --> 23:22.483
- [Tommy] How we doin'?
- Range is pretty compromised.

23:22.484 --> 23:24.402
But you heard
from all of 'em, right?
They're on their way back?

23:24.403 --> 23:25.779
Or taking shelter, yeah.

23:26.780 --> 23:28.322
Except Joel and Dina.

23:28.323 --> 23:29.573
[static buzzing]

23:29.574 --> 23:32.326
- Well, where the fuck are they?
- I don't know.

23:32.327 --> 23:33.994
They're not responding.

23:33.995 --> 23:35.663
Try 'em again.

23:35.664 --> 23:36.748
Again!

23:39.084 --> 23:41.210
Copper Mine,
this is Jackson, come in.

23:41.211 --> 23:43.255
[static warbling]

23:46.425 --> 23:47.926
Copper Mine, come in.

23:49.928 --> 23:51.930
[static buzzing]

23:53.265 --> 23:55.599
Joel, answer the goddamn radio!

23:55.600 --> 23:58.645
[static warbling]

24:02.065 --> 24:03.150
Fuck!

24:04.901 --> 24:07.361
Every ten seconds, Amy.
You hear me?

24:07.362 --> 24:08.989
Every ten seconds!

24:10.031 --> 24:12.492
[Amy] Copper Mine,
this is Jackson, come in.

24:15.787 --> 24:18.706
- [Ellie] [muffled] Jesse.
- What?

24:18.707 --> 24:20.374
- [muffled] Check it.
- [scoffs]

24:20.375 --> 24:23.461
[chuckles]
Did he make this?

24:23.462 --> 24:25.629
- Yeah.
- I'm taking this with me.

24:25.630 --> 24:27.715
- No, you're not.
- Yes, I am.

24:27.716 --> 24:30.551
And as much weed
as I can shove into my pack.

24:30.552 --> 24:32.386
- Nope.
- Dude, you're gonna be in charge

24:32.387 --> 24:33.888
of Jackson one day,
we all know.

24:33.889 --> 24:35.639
But that day
has not yet come.

24:35.640 --> 24:37.224
[Amy distorted over radio]

24:37.225 --> 24:38.935
[static warbling]

24:42.481 --> 24:44.064
Repeat.

24:44.065 --> 24:46.734
[Amy] [distorted over radio]
Copper Mine, do you copy?

24:46.735 --> 24:49.029
This is Jesse,
you're barely there. Amy?

24:50.405 --> 24:53.240
[Amy] [distorted]
Jesse, have you seen
Joel or Dina?

24:53.241 --> 24:55.159
[Jesse] Repeat.

24:55.160 --> 24:57.661
[Amy] [distorted]
Have you heard from
Joel or Dina?

24:57.662 --> 24:58.747
No, why?

24:59.831 --> 25:02.750
[Amy]
They haven't checked in.
Are you near Copper Mine?

25:02.751 --> 25:04.711
- [whispering] Fuck.
- Amy.

25:06.338 --> 25:07.421
Amy, come back.

25:07.422 --> 25:09.341
[static warbling]

25:10.258 --> 25:11.259
Amy!

25:14.012 --> 25:15.347
[exhales sharply]

25:19.059 --> 25:22.062
[♪ dramatic music playing]

25:25.857 --> 25:27.275
[grunting]

25:36.618 --> 25:38.994
- [grunting]
- [Cordyceps rustling]

25:38.995 --> 25:41.831
[♪ tense, ominous music playing]

25:44.543 --> 25:46.168
[Jesse]
The route's an oval
around the mine.

25:46.169 --> 25:48.295
We gotta split up
and come at it from both sides.

25:48.296 --> 25:50.381
Northwest and northeast.
Meet up in the middle.

25:50.382 --> 25:52.800
I'll take northeast.
How much time do
you think we have?

25:52.801 --> 25:54.510
If the wind holds steady,
maybe 20 minutes.

25:54.511 --> 25:55.803
You gotta get
to the mine by then,

25:55.804 --> 25:57.221
Ellie, whether you
find them or not.

25:57.222 --> 25:59.057
- Yeah, you fucking too, Jesse.
- [horse whinnying]

26:01.393 --> 26:03.395
[♪ dramatic music playing]

26:08.608 --> 26:10.401
[Dina]
Joel, we gotta go faster!

26:10.402 --> 26:11.987
[Joel]
I know! I'm tryin'!

26:15.615 --> 26:17.617
[infected clamoring]

26:19.828 --> 26:21.830
[Cordyceps rustling]

26:26.126 --> 26:28.128
[grunting]

26:30.839 --> 26:32.715
[distant screeching]

26:32.716 --> 26:33.925
[gasps]

26:36.970 --> 26:39.973
[♪ suspenseful music playing]

26:43.059 --> 26:45.061
[snarling and screeching]

27:04.247 --> 27:06.249
[people chattering]

27:06.833 --> 27:08.126
Tommy!

27:09.085 --> 27:10.544
Tommy!

27:10.545 --> 27:12.839
[wind whistling]

27:26.686 --> 27:30.147
Bell! Bell! Hit the bell!

27:30.148 --> 27:32.609
[bell ringing]

27:34.027 --> 27:36.029
[panting]

27:36.946 --> 27:39.073
- They're coming!
- Raiders or infected?

27:39.074 --> 27:40.407
Infected!
Five minutes out!

27:40.408 --> 27:42.076
[Maria]
Follow the plan.
I'll take the roofs.

27:42.077 --> 27:43.370
You take Main Street.

27:45.538 --> 27:46.873
- Go.
- [guard] Go! Let's go!

27:48.416 --> 27:50.918
[Maria]
Hey, you two with me!
Roofs! Let's go!

27:50.919 --> 27:52.962
- [bell ringing]
- [people shouting]

27:55.090 --> 27:57.257
[Tommy] [on bullhorn]
Basements and roofs!

27:57.258 --> 28:00.928
Basements and roofs!
Get off the street!

28:00.929 --> 28:02.596
[bell continues ringing]

28:02.597 --> 28:03.640
[panting] Okay.

28:04.140 --> 28:05.266
[door bangs open]

28:06.476 --> 28:08.478
[people panting]

28:08.853 --> 28:10.855
[baby fussing and crying]

28:15.026 --> 28:16.903
[thudding]

28:17.529 --> 28:18.530
Hurry!

28:19.823 --> 28:21.825
[metallic creaking]

28:27.455 --> 28:29.708
[bell ringing]

28:33.420 --> 28:35.462
[infected clamoring]

28:35.463 --> 28:38.466
[♪ suspenseful music playing]

28:41.803 --> 28:43.555
[growling and snarling]

28:47.684 --> 28:49.685
[tank hissing]

28:49.686 --> 28:51.730
[bell continues ringing]

28:52.313 --> 28:53.314
[grunts]

28:55.692 --> 28:57.485
[clamoring continues]

29:01.114 --> 29:03.116
[motor rumbling]

29:16.337 --> 29:19.340
[♪ suspenseful music continues]

29:30.351 --> 29:32.353
[distant clamoring]

29:37.484 --> 29:40.527
- Jackson Hole!
- [guards] Jackson Hole!

29:40.528 --> 29:42.446
Get ready!

29:42.447 --> 29:43.573
[barrels clanging]

29:44.824 --> 29:47.367
[clamoring intensifies]

29:47.368 --> 29:48.911
[loud banging]

29:48.912 --> 29:50.455
[crunching]

29:51.664 --> 29:53.666
- [banging continues]
- [wheels creaking]

29:55.710 --> 29:57.295
Push! Push!

29:58.588 --> 30:00.298
- Go, go, go!
- [Tommy] Go! Go!

30:01.174 --> 30:02.091
Push!

30:03.843 --> 30:04.844
[crunching]

30:05.261 --> 30:06.262
Push!

30:10.767 --> 30:12.392
[growling and snarling]

30:12.393 --> 30:14.603
Rifles!

30:14.604 --> 30:16.648
[gunfire]

30:17.398 --> 30:18.399
[yells]

30:20.443 --> 30:22.195
[bullets whizzing]

30:25.406 --> 30:27.408
[gunfire continues]

30:28.493 --> 30:29.577
[shrieking]

30:31.371 --> 30:33.247
Now! Now!

30:33.248 --> 30:36.251
[♪ tense music playing]

30:43.758 --> 30:45.009
[Tommy grunting]

30:49.722 --> 30:51.724
[explosions booming]

30:54.269 --> 30:56.271
[infected screeching]

30:57.689 --> 30:59.691
- [gunfire continues]
- [explosions continue]

31:04.028 --> 31:06.781
[screeching continues]

31:26.467 --> 31:29.011
- Whoa! Whoa.
- [horse neighing]

31:29.012 --> 31:30.846
[all panting]

31:30.847 --> 31:32.723
[Dina]
What? Oh, God.

31:32.724 --> 31:34.892
- [Joel] I have to go back.
- [Dina] We won't make it.

31:34.893 --> 31:36.978
- If I don't make it,
I don't make it.
- We're almost there!

31:38.563 --> 31:41.189
The lodge is just up ahead.
It's like a minute.

31:41.190 --> 31:43.150
- Really?
- We've got blankets, ammo.

31:43.151 --> 31:44.818
My friends can help you
get back.

31:44.819 --> 31:46.112
We can fight.

31:51.576 --> 31:52.702
Fast!

31:54.370 --> 31:56.915
- [gunfire continues]
- [shells jingling]

32:02.795 --> 32:04.714
[infected screeching]

32:05.632 --> 32:07.634
- [fire roaring]
- [screeching continues]

32:09.844 --> 32:11.679
[gunfire continues]

32:17.644 --> 32:20.687
[♪ ominous music playing]

32:20.688 --> 32:22.690
[distant roaring]

32:30.156 --> 32:32.158
[distant roaring continues]

32:35.995 --> 32:37.997
[Bloater roaring]

32:41.084 --> 32:42.584
[guards shouting]

32:42.585 --> 32:47.048
They're gonna breach.
They're gonna breach!

32:47.966 --> 32:49.466
[loud banging]

32:49.467 --> 32:52.052
- [deep growling]
- [wood cracking]

32:52.053 --> 32:53.972
[heavy panting]

32:54.722 --> 32:57.141
They're breaking through!
Get ready!

33:01.729 --> 33:03.272
Get in there.

33:04.983 --> 33:06.985
[flame thrower whooshing]

33:08.653 --> 33:10.989
[♪ tense music playing]

33:11.864 --> 33:13.700
[banging]

33:16.035 --> 33:18.538
- [roaring]
- [infected clamoring]

33:21.833 --> 33:24.836
[♪ suspenseful music playing]

33:26.921 --> 33:28.673
[guns clicking]

33:29.674 --> 33:32.135
[screeching]

33:33.636 --> 33:35.345
[gunfire]

33:35.346 --> 33:37.432
[growling and snarling]

33:46.024 --> 33:48.150
[gunfire continues]

33:48.151 --> 33:49.986
[clamoring continues]

33:55.908 --> 33:57.785
[glass shattering]

33:59.037 --> 34:01.247
- [muffled clamoring]
- [banging]

34:03.082 --> 34:04.124
[door rattling]

34:04.125 --> 34:06.627
[screeching and snarling]

34:07.462 --> 34:08.629
[yelling]

34:11.632 --> 34:13.051
- [screeching]
- [guard yelling]

34:17.305 --> 34:19.639
- [flame thrower whooshing]
- [infected snarling]

34:19.640 --> 34:21.267
[shrieking]

34:23.936 --> 34:25.730
[screaming]

34:26.731 --> 34:28.149
[guard whimpering]

34:30.026 --> 34:32.194
[Bloater growling]

34:32.195 --> 34:34.697
[gunfire continues]

34:35.656 --> 34:36.783
[screaming]

34:37.658 --> 34:39.660
[growling]

34:40.828 --> 34:43.039
[roaring]

34:46.959 --> 34:48.127
Hey!

34:49.212 --> 34:51.172
Hey! Hey!

34:55.510 --> 34:57.553
Hey! Right here!

34:58.596 --> 35:00.055
Hey!

35:00.056 --> 35:02.390
[snarling and growling]

35:02.391 --> 35:03.893
Come here! Come here!

35:08.940 --> 35:11.234
[roaring]

35:12.610 --> 35:14.694
[gunfire continues]

35:14.695 --> 35:15.780
[infected screeching]

35:19.575 --> 35:20.576
[guard grunts]

35:23.579 --> 35:24.704
- You good?
- [infected snarling]

35:24.705 --> 35:25.915
[guard screams]

35:29.710 --> 35:31.920
[panting]

35:31.921 --> 35:34.966
[♪ tense music playing]

35:39.554 --> 35:40.554
No!

35:40.555 --> 35:41.763
[grunting]

35:41.764 --> 35:42.932
[panting]

35:44.475 --> 35:45.893
Fuck!

35:47.436 --> 35:49.230
[growling]

35:54.610 --> 35:56.696
[shouting]

35:57.530 --> 35:59.239
[deep growling]

35:59.240 --> 36:00.658
[panting, yelling]

36:01.033 --> 36:03.035
[growling]

36:08.374 --> 36:10.417
- [shouting]
- [flame thrower whooshing]

36:10.418 --> 36:13.504
[Bloater roaring]

36:27.435 --> 36:28.686
[grunting]

36:29.687 --> 36:32.231
- [growling]
- [flame thrower whooshing]

36:35.401 --> 36:37.319
- [tank hissing]
- [Tommy shouting]

36:37.320 --> 36:39.362
- [Bloater roaring]
- [footsteps stomping]

36:39.363 --> 36:40.990
[Tommy shouting]

36:42.200 --> 36:45.452
[tank hissing]

36:45.453 --> 36:47.704
[shouting]

36:47.705 --> 36:49.582
Come on, let's go!

36:51.500 --> 36:53.502
[hissing weakening]

36:54.420 --> 36:55.463
[yells]

36:56.297 --> 36:57.715
[flame throwing clicking]

36:58.341 --> 37:00.343
[snarling]

37:01.594 --> 37:04.513
[roaring]

37:09.268 --> 37:10.477
[flames sizzling]

37:10.478 --> 37:12.521
[panting]

37:14.106 --> 37:15.191
Jesus.

37:16.817 --> 37:18.319
[grunting]

37:22.448 --> 37:25.201
- [gunfire]
- [people shouting]

37:27.036 --> 37:28.871
[grunting and snarling]

37:31.040 --> 37:32.541
[screeching and shouting]

37:34.168 --> 37:35.252
- [gunshot]
- [grunts]

37:35.253 --> 37:37.420
[Maria panting]

37:37.421 --> 37:39.507
[dogs barking]

37:42.301 --> 37:43.302
Go!

37:44.095 --> 37:46.346
[barking continues]

37:46.347 --> 37:47.348
Go!

37:49.642 --> 37:52.519
[gunfire continues]

37:52.520 --> 37:54.105
[flames roaring]

37:56.732 --> 37:59.360
[Tommy grunting]

38:00.611 --> 38:03.406
[dogs barking]

38:04.865 --> 38:06.574
- [infected snarling]
- [dogs growling]

38:06.575 --> 38:08.619
[infected shrieking]

38:13.040 --> 38:14.917
- [dog growling]
- [infected choking]

38:19.505 --> 38:21.340
- [Mel] Abby!
- [Nora] Abby!

38:22.133 --> 38:24.759
- [Manny] Abby!
- Abby!

38:24.760 --> 38:27.387
- Abby!
- [Manny] Abby!

38:27.388 --> 38:28.888
- [Mel] Hey, horses!
- [Owen] Horses!

38:28.889 --> 38:31.183
- Horses!
- We got horses!

38:33.602 --> 38:35.604
[wind whooshing]

38:36.814 --> 38:37.815
[Abby grunts]

38:40.109 --> 38:43.487
Come on. Come on.
Inside! Inside!

38:44.530 --> 38:46.239
[shivering]

38:46.240 --> 38:47.658
[Nora]
Abby, you okay?

38:49.535 --> 38:52.580
Oh, fuck.
[shivering]

38:53.914 --> 38:55.916
- [Joel panting]
- [Dina shivering]

38:58.627 --> 39:00.171
Help them too.

39:04.216 --> 39:06.593
[bags zipping]

39:06.594 --> 39:08.928
[Mel]
No, no, no, uh, let's keep
your coat on, alright?

39:08.929 --> 39:11.306
It's okay.
I think I see

39:11.307 --> 39:12.807
just a little frostbite
on your wrist,

39:12.808 --> 39:15.310
but it's not too bad.
I'm gonna take a look.

39:15.311 --> 39:16.811
Easy.
We're gonna raise

39:16.812 --> 39:18.980
your body temperature
up slowly, okay?

39:18.981 --> 39:21.816
[shivering] What's the...
who are you?

39:21.817 --> 39:24.277
Hang on. I gotta jump on this,
or you're gonna lose skin.

39:24.278 --> 39:25.862
[Joel] Okay, everybody
grab blankets, ammo,

39:25.863 --> 39:27.405
whatever weapons you have,
we're headin' out

39:27.406 --> 39:29.324
- in three minutes.
- Uh, sorry.

39:29.325 --> 39:31.618
I'm-- I'm Abby.

39:31.619 --> 39:34.329
This is Nora, Manny,
Owen, and Mel.

39:34.330 --> 39:35.789
Jackson, come in.

39:35.790 --> 39:37.792
Tommy, come in.
Do you copy?

39:38.793 --> 39:39.834
Her name's Dina.

39:39.835 --> 39:41.461
- [Joel] Jackson, come in.
- Dina?

39:41.462 --> 39:43.214
- [Joel] Jackson!
- [Abby] And he...

39:44.673 --> 39:46.132
is Joel.

39:46.133 --> 39:48.468
[Joel]
Hey, Jackson, do you copy?

39:48.469 --> 39:50.804
Does anyone copy?
Any patrols, anyone?

39:50.805 --> 39:53.306
- Tommy, if you can hear me,
we've got these--
- Joel. Joel. Joel.

39:53.307 --> 39:54.850
Ch-ch-ch, ah-ah.

39:56.060 --> 39:58.354
[♪ tense music playing]

40:02.191 --> 40:03.609
We're not gonna hurt her.

40:05.403 --> 40:07.987
Not if you cooperate.

40:07.988 --> 40:10.116
We're just gonna put her
to sleep for a while.

40:12.451 --> 40:14.537
Trust me.
It's for the best.

40:16.080 --> 40:17.164
Do it.

40:20.251 --> 40:22.420
If you don't do it,
I'm gonna smash her
in the fuckin' head.

40:25.881 --> 40:28.258
You wanna rob us?
Fine, take what you want.

40:28.259 --> 40:30.469
Do we look like raiders to you?

40:35.641 --> 40:36.642
No.

40:37.977 --> 40:39.478
What do we look like?

40:42.606 --> 40:43.816
Military.

40:49.697 --> 40:50.823
Fireflies?

40:51.824 --> 40:55.119
Used to be.
Haven't you heard?

40:56.662 --> 40:58.622
There are no more Fireflies.

41:00.124 --> 41:01.667
They're all gone.

41:02.418 --> 41:04.420
[♪ tense music continues]

41:09.884 --> 41:11.551
- [softly] Okay.
- [Dina gasps]

41:11.552 --> 41:14.053
[grunts] No, get--
Get that shit away from--

41:14.054 --> 41:15.930
This is gonna put you to sleep.
This is going to put you

41:15.931 --> 41:18.225
to sleep for one hour.
That is all, I promise.

41:19.018 --> 41:20.102
I promise.

41:20.853 --> 41:22.229
[Dina panting]

41:25.774 --> 41:27.526
No. No. No!

41:30.029 --> 41:31.238
[gasps]

41:32.323 --> 41:33.324
[thuds]

41:37.203 --> 41:38.578
[softly exhales]

41:38.579 --> 41:41.207
[Abby]
See? Breathing.

41:47.087 --> 41:49.423
That's a nice scar you have
on your right temple there.

41:50.341 --> 41:53.177
I'd say you're about,
what, six feet?

41:54.136 --> 41:55.596
In your 60s now?

41:57.306 --> 41:59.767
[chuckling] You actually
are pretty handsome.

42:01.101 --> 42:02.269
Congrats on that.

42:07.316 --> 42:10.778
I'm gonna give you one chance
to tell the truth, Joel.

42:11.987 --> 42:15.157
If you do... let's face it.

42:16.116 --> 42:17.701
We'll all know.

42:19.370 --> 42:20.621
I'll let her live.

42:21.622 --> 42:24.083
- Wait, Abby, I thought--
- Shut up!

42:30.422 --> 42:34.218
Where was the last place
you saw the Fireflies?

42:47.314 --> 42:48.691
Salt Lake.

42:52.027 --> 42:53.529
At least you're honest.

42:59.034 --> 43:00.369
I saved your life.

43:01.287 --> 43:02.454
What life?

43:03.163 --> 43:06.041
[Joel screaming, grunting]

43:09.753 --> 43:12.131
[sighs]
Tourniquet him.

43:13.173 --> 43:14.841
Mel, let's just do
what we came to do.

43:14.842 --> 43:16.844
[Joel gasping]

43:18.220 --> 43:20.723
[belt rattling]

43:21.765 --> 43:24.101
[Joel grunting]

43:25.352 --> 43:27.354
[Joel breathing heavily]

43:28.397 --> 43:30.565
[Joel screaming]

43:30.566 --> 43:32.610
[♪ tense music playing]

43:40.826 --> 43:42.119
You're tough.

43:43.662 --> 43:46.707
I guess you probably have to be,
killing all those people.

43:47.708 --> 43:49.668
Do you know how many
you killed that day?

43:51.003 --> 43:52.880
Did you count
as you went, or...

43:54.131 --> 43:56.008
I guess maybe it just
didn't matter?

43:58.927 --> 44:00.846
Eighteen soldiers.

44:02.514 --> 44:04.016
And one doctor.

44:07.478 --> 44:09.146
You remember that one.

44:10.773 --> 44:15.777
An unarmed doctor
you shot in the head.

44:15.778 --> 44:17.363
[inaudible]

44:19.490 --> 44:20.574
Yeah.

44:22.201 --> 44:23.786
That was my dad.

44:25.954 --> 44:27.706
Guess you probably
already figured.

44:30.834 --> 44:32.794
The nurses said you barely
even looked at him

44:32.795 --> 44:34.254
when you pulled the trigger.

44:36.340 --> 44:38.925
And then, you just walked
right past his body

44:38.926 --> 44:40.386
and out the door.

44:43.806 --> 44:45.099
But I looked at him.

44:48.227 --> 44:49.478
I saw him.

44:52.231 --> 44:53.982
I was 19.

45:02.157 --> 45:04.159
[sobbing softly]

45:07.663 --> 45:11.500
I've been in a militia
for five years now.

45:12.459 --> 45:14.293
Seattle.
I'd warn you not to go there,

45:14.294 --> 45:17.004
but little chance of that.

45:17.005 --> 45:21.760
Anyway, our commander
trained us to follow a code.

45:23.303 --> 45:26.181
We don't kill people
that can't defend themselves.

45:32.604 --> 45:34.189
And right now...

45:36.233 --> 45:37.317
that's you.

45:40.946 --> 45:43.615
But I am going to kill you.

45:46.702 --> 45:49.912
Because it doesn't matter

45:49.913 --> 45:52.373
if you have a code like me,

45:52.374 --> 45:56.962
or you're a lawless
piece of shit like you.

46:01.258 --> 46:03.010
There are just some things...

46:04.636 --> 46:10.058
everyone agrees
are just fucking wrong.

46:17.357 --> 46:19.359
[sobbing]

46:26.366 --> 46:27.951
[sighs]

46:34.625 --> 46:35.959
[sniffling]

46:44.551 --> 46:45.844
[sighs]

46:47.095 --> 46:49.430
You know, it's funny.
I have waited so long--

46:49.431 --> 46:52.059
[Joel]
Oh, just shut the fuck up
and do it already.

47:03.779 --> 47:05.072
[sighs]

47:07.574 --> 47:09.827
[♪ tense music playing]

47:16.708 --> 47:17.876
You...

47:19.837 --> 47:23.048
stupid... old man.

47:28.011 --> 47:29.888
You don't get to rush this.

47:36.562 --> 47:38.313
[Joel screaming]

47:40.607 --> 47:42.651
- [Abby grunting]
- [Joel screaming]

47:44.361 --> 47:46.362
[panting]

47:46.363 --> 47:49.532
- [shouting]
- [Joel screaming]

47:49.533 --> 47:52.578
[♪ dramatic music playing]

47:59.167 --> 48:00.794
[horse whinnying]

48:09.219 --> 48:10.596
[grunts]

48:16.977 --> 48:19.980
- [Abby shouting]
- [fists thudding]

48:22.983 --> 48:24.985
- [Mel sobbing]
- [Abby grunting]

48:29.448 --> 48:31.657
[Abby continues shouting]

48:31.658 --> 48:32.743
Abby.

48:34.411 --> 48:37.164
- [Abby shouting]
- Abby.

48:37.915 --> 48:38.957
[shouting echoes]

48:41.585 --> 48:43.253
- [horse neighing]
- [Ellie] Whoa.

48:47.466 --> 48:50.469
[♪ suspenseful music playing]

48:51.553 --> 48:53.555
[wind whistling]

49:01.438 --> 49:03.065
[muffled thudding]

49:11.156 --> 49:14.701
[faint shouting]

49:15.619 --> 49:17.870
[loud thuds]

49:17.871 --> 49:20.207
[shouting continues]

49:22.459 --> 49:23.961
[Owen]
That's enough!

49:25.128 --> 49:27.255
- [Abby shouting]
- [fists thudding]

49:28.966 --> 49:30.384
- [grunting]
- No!

49:32.344 --> 49:34.012
- [grunting]
- Ah! Fuck!

49:36.139 --> 49:38.557
[grunting]

49:38.558 --> 49:40.102
- [knife clatters]
- [Ellie crying]

49:42.604 --> 49:44.438
- Stupid fucking bitch!
- No!

49:44.439 --> 49:46.566
- No!
- [Ellie screaming]

49:47.651 --> 49:49.903
- [Owen] No!
- Joel!

49:50.904 --> 49:52.238
Joel! Joel!

49:52.239 --> 49:53.991
Joel, get up.

49:54.992 --> 49:56.243
Joel, get up.

49:57.494 --> 49:58.954
Joel, fucking get up!

50:00.330 --> 50:02.915
Joel, get up.
[whispers] Get up.

50:02.916 --> 50:03.958
End it.

50:03.959 --> 50:06.920
Joel, get up.
Please.

50:08.171 --> 50:11.008
Please, get up. Get up.

50:13.343 --> 50:15.971
[grunting]
Fucking get up!

50:18.223 --> 50:20.225
[panting]

50:21.309 --> 50:22.686
Get up. Get up.

50:24.396 --> 50:25.814
[sobbing]
Get up.

50:32.195 --> 50:33.321
No.

50:35.407 --> 50:37.158
Please, no, please.

50:37.159 --> 50:39.618
Please don't.
Please-- please don't.

50:39.619 --> 50:41.370
Please don't do it! Please!

50:41.371 --> 50:43.497
Please don't!
Don't!

50:43.498 --> 50:46.167
Please don't! Don't!

50:46.168 --> 50:47.210
[metal clangs]

50:47.586 --> 50:49.588
[muffled screaming]

50:53.216 --> 50:55.551
[high-pitch whistling]

50:55.552 --> 50:59.014
[inaudible]

51:03.018 --> 51:05.020
[muffled shouting]

51:10.484 --> 51:12.985
[gasps]

51:12.986 --> 51:14.446
I'm gonna kill you.

51:16.114 --> 51:17.616
I'm gonna kill you!

51:18.241 --> 51:19.658
You're gonna die!

51:19.659 --> 51:21.660
You're all gonna fucking die!

51:21.661 --> 51:23.662
- [kick thuds]
- [gasps]

51:23.663 --> 51:26.041
[wheezing]

51:43.183 --> 51:44.976
Fucking pendejo.

51:47.062 --> 51:49.189
[Ellie whimpering]

51:54.653 --> 51:57.071
[♪ somber music playing]

51:57.072 --> 51:59.116
[grunting]

52:06.039 --> 52:07.332
[exhales sharply]

52:09.042 --> 52:11.044
[panting]

52:16.925 --> 52:18.802
- [grunting]
- [metal clanging]

52:25.517 --> 52:27.519
[Ellie whimpering]

52:35.610 --> 52:38.529
[fire crackling]

52:38.530 --> 52:41.992
[♪ "Through the Valley"
by Ashley Johnson and
Chris Rondinella playing]

52:46.955 --> 52:51.750
♪ I walk
through the valley ♪

52:51.751 --> 52:56.005
♪ Of the shadow of death ♪

52:56.006 --> 53:00.259
♪ And I fear no evil ♪

53:00.260 --> 53:05.264
♪ Because
I'm blind to it all ♪

53:05.265 --> 53:08.809
♪ And my mind
and my gun ♪

53:08.810 --> 53:11.271
♪ They comfort me ♪

53:14.065 --> 53:18.819
♪ Because I know
I'll kill my enemies ♪

53:18.820 --> 53:20.947
♪ When they come ♪

53:23.658 --> 53:28.287
♪ Surely, goodness
and mercy will follow me ♪

53:28.288 --> 53:32.124
- ♪ All the days of my life ♪
- [gunshot]

53:32.125 --> 53:35.794
♪ And I will dwell
on this Earth ♪

53:35.795 --> 53:40.799
♪ Forevermore ♪

53:40.800 --> 53:44.386
♪ Said I walk beside
the still waters ♪

53:44.387 --> 53:49.141
♪ And they restore my soul ♪

53:49.142 --> 53:53.646
♪ But I can't walk
on the path of the right ♪

53:53.647 --> 53:55.857
♪ Because I'm wrong ♪

53:57.817 --> 54:01.695
♪ 'Cause I walk
through the valley ♪

54:01.696 --> 54:05.866
♪ Of the shadow of death ♪

54:05.867 --> 54:09.828
♪ And I fear no evil ♪

54:09.829 --> 54:13.707
♪ Because I'm blind ♪

54:13.708 --> 54:17.336
♪ Oh, and I walk beside
the still waters ♪

54:17.337 --> 54:21.882
♪ And they restore my soul ♪

54:21.883 --> 54:25.344
♪ But I know when I die ♪

54:25.345 --> 54:28.765
♪ My soul is damned ♪

54:29.975 --> 54:34.062
♪ But I know when I die ♪

54:35.605 --> 54:40.777
♪ My soul is damned ♪

54:43.571 --> 54:46.783
[wind blowing softly]

54:54.916 --> 54:58.336
[wind continues blowing]

55:32.329 --> 55:34.581
[wind continues blowing]
